:"324326","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"478668","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"110661","synopsis":"Insomniac accepts his engagement to Ellie, the castellan's daughter, but conflicting motives begin to emerge behind the arrangement. During a sword tournament at the castle, Swordsman and Ellie advance to the semifinals, where they face off in a fierce duel. Later, Ellie learns she has been chosen to accompany Insomniac as a knight commander aide on his journey to the Country of Long Nights.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6cC7rpr5AcQHC89P4QkgOAo8D5c.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"20074","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"64326","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"324326","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"478668","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"110808","synopsis":"As they journey to the Country of Long Nights, Ellie begins to notice subtle changes in Insomniac, whom she has known since childhood, that leave her uneasy. They arrive in a land where blue flowers bloom, and preparations are underway for the annual Walpurga Eve festival. But beneath its peaceful surface, Insomniac senses an ominous presence, and the country's hidden secrets slowly come to light.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z7r7YNNfGcr6mY8nSq2nMlm13RJ.jpg"}]}]}
